7. Visual Design Standards

A. Status Color System
- Green (#4CAF50): Excellent/Good status
- Yellow (#FF9800): Fair/Needs attention
- Red (#F44336): Critical/Poor status
- Blue (#2196F3): Informational/Neutral

B. Typography Hierarchy
- H4: Section headers with status context
- H6: Card titles with status indicators
- Body1: Primary content with status colors
- Caption: Status metadata and timestamps

C. Spacing and Layout
- Card spacing: 16px between cards
- Grid gaps: 24px for main content, 16px for metrics
- Status indicators: 8px margin from text
- Consistent padding: 16px for card content

